{"id":"662672","name":"竹笋炒鸡丝","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/662672/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"250g"},{"name":"竹笋","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"青椒","amount":"30g"},{"name":"红椒","amount":"30g"},{"name":"葱","amount":"5g"},{"name":"姜","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜竹笋。","img":"images/662672/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"竹笋洗净。","img":"images/662672/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切丝。","img":"images/662672/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"焯水，捞出，放入盘中，备用。","img":"images/662672/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡胸肉洗净。","img":"images/662672/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切丝。","img":"images/662672/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"青椒、红椒去蒂、去子，洗净切丝。","img":"images/662672/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"葱切段，姜切片，备用。","img":"images/662672/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"先把鸡丝加盐、料酒、水淀粉拌匀，腌渍备用。锅置火上，倒油烧热，爆香葱段、姜片，放入鸡丝炒散。再加笋丝、青椒丝、红椒丝翻炒，加适量水盖盖焖至将熟，加盐调味即可。","img":"images/662672/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅装盘。","img":"images/662672/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"鲜嫩美味可口。","img":"images/662672/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}